# Pass 4, "sans-odyssey": the game without the Odyssey DLC. Plays 17. Without it neither `Dig` nor `Forage` exists,
# and the mod has to fall back on obedience alone (FUNCTIONAL-SCENARIOS.md scenarios 10 and 16). Odyssey is in the
# mod's `loadAfter` and nowhere in `modDependencies`, precisely so that this pass is possible.
#
# The first line leaves the DLC out of the staged mod list (see PickleTools/Headless/README.md). The second stages the
# two steps that ask ModsConfig, the list the game itself keeps, whether it is active: nothing in the staging says
# whether the game keeps a DLC out once a save is loaded, and this pass has to establish that before anything else it
# says is worth reading (PickleTools/ExpansionSteps/README.md).
#
# Played with:  -DepMap wsl-deps.sans-odyssey.map -Filter '17-without-odyssey.feature'
!ludeon.rimworld.odyssey
nelim.pickletools.expansions path:PickleTools/ExpansionSteps/Mod
